 r←Test_Server_013(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;request;response;ind;lines;locs
⍝ Requests "sitemap.xml" and checks its contents
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 request←R.NewRequest 0
 request.RequestTarget←'/sitemap.xml'
 response←TC.SendAndReceive(TC.ReplaceRegistryAlias'[localhost]')request
 →T.PassesIf 200=response.StatusCode
 →T.PassesIf(≢response.Headers)≥ind←(⊃¨response.Headers)⍳⊂'content-type'
 →T.PassesIf∨/'application/xml'⍷ind 2⊃response.Headers

 lines←A.Split response.Content
 →T.PassesIf'<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>'≡⊃lines
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">'⍷response.Content
 →T.PassesIf∨/'</urlset>'⍷response.Content
 →T.PassesIf∨/{∨/'<lastmod>'⍷⍵}¨lines

 locs←lines/⍨{∨/'<loc>'⍷⍵}¨lines
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢locs
 →T.PassesIf∧/{∨/'<loc>https://'⍷⍵}¨locs                ⍝ All URLs must be absolute
 →T.PassesIf 0=+/{∨/'/packages/details/'⍷⍵}¨locs        ⍝ Those are not supposed to be indexed
 →T.PassesIf 0=+/{∨/'/packages/major_versions/'⍷⍵}¨locs ⍝ Neither are those
 →T.PassesIf 0<+/{∨/'/packages/versions/'⍷⍵}¨locs       ⍝ But those are the whole point of the exercise

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
